{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-burj-azizi","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"azizi-burj-trade-center","about":"Introducing Burj Azizi – a groundbreaking new launch by Azizi Developments, set to become the world’s second-tallest tower at an astonishing 725 meters. Nestled along Sheikh Zayed Road, this iconic marvel features ultra-luxury 1–2 bedroom apartments and expansive 2–5 bedroom penthouses, all boasting panoramic views of Dubai’s skyline and the Arabian Gulf. Each residence is crafted to perfection, blending opulence, comfort, and style within a vertical sanctuary of refined living. With over 133 floors, the tower redefines urban luxury and offers a truly immersive residential experience.Burj Azizi is not just a home; it’s a self-sustaining vertical city that integrates a seven-star hotel, the world’s highest observation deck on the 130th floor, a revolutionary multi-level vertical mall, and fine dining among the clouds. Residents will enjoy amenities like a wellness spa perched at 415 meters, the highest supermarket at 310 meters, a fitness center, community café, and a sky-high nightclub. Positioned in a prime location with direct access to Dubai’s top landmarks, Burj Azizi embodies architectural brilliance, luxury living, and a legacy of innovation for generations to come.","price":8450000,"title":"Burj Azizi","bitrix":{"id":588,"pf_id":"are.2.13489","source":null,"project_id":"Burj Azizi","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Burj Azizi","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Azizi Developments","project_location":"Sheikh Zayed Road"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Burj_Azizi_at_Sheikh_Zayed_Road_095a9544c8.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Burj_Azizi_at_Sheikh_Zayed_Road_095a9544c8.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.2216115,"lng":55.2814104},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x2